WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:01.990
- On this the eve of Christmas

00:00:01.990 --> 00:00:04.580
I wanted to bring to your
attention the gift of one lawyer,

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.500
one Lin Wood, one of the two main lawyers

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.970
in charge of all the election lawsuits

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.540
along with Sidney Powell.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.870
Mr. Wood filed a verified complaint.

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.120
That's a complaint where you swear

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.740
that the allegations alleged
therein are true and correct.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.970
It helps you overcome some
of the evidentiary hurdles

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.710
that you might face when
you file a complaint

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.020
and of course, when you attest
to a verified complaint,

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.470
like signing an affidavit,

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.060
you swear under penalty of perjury.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.290
Of course in the most
Freudian of slips ever,

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:32.420
Mr. Woods signed under plenty of perjury,

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.160
not under penalty of perjury.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.700
That is just the gift that keeps on giving

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.610
and if you'd like even more holiday cheer,

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:41.550
check out the video I did
on all the laws broken

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.640
in National Lampoon's Christmas Vacation

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.403
and I'll see you in court.

